{"id":"n64854-1-14","stage":5,"title":"수치 · 羞耻","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64854-1-14-1","ko":"이렇게 나이가 들어서 학교를 다니려니 너무 창피합니다.","zh":"都这么大了还要去上学，实在让人觉得太难为情了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이렇게","meaning":"这样","explanation":"이렇다：这样；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"이렇다","audio":"/audio/c2f95cfd19c5a89b2cd1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71157","senseId":"1","lemma":"이렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이렇게","audio":"/audio/9a767a1c9118d82c3af9.mp3"}},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이가","audio":"/audio/61d19a9f3b9c5119f3e9.mp3"}},{"text":"들어서","meaning":"上(年纪)","explanation":"들다：上(年纪)；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"19","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어서","audio":"/audio/1958524b05c63f4d1762.mp3"}},{"text":"학교를","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교를","audio":"/audio/5c0f3953da1ff7d62c97.mp3"}},{"text":"다니려니","meaning":"上班，上学，上","explanation":"다니다：上班，上学，上；려니：说明正要或打算做某事时所遇到的情况、想法或困难。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"3","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다니려니","audio":"/audio/706026522db2a8da5df0.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太。","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"e